  "type": "Video",
  "shortCode": "De9p1sfIgD0",
  "caption": "ad I’m officially a @monzo brand ambassador AHHHHHH!!! 🥹🩷 I have been SITTING ON THIS SECRET for what feels like an eternity and after bugging the teams in person, email, pigeon and every form of correspondence, TODAY IS FINALLY THE DAY I CAN TELL YOU. I’ve been incredibly emotional about this (ever since the initial email came through earlier this year) and it’s one of the biggest career announcements I’ve ever made and a huge personal milestone.\n\nI didn’t grow up with money nor did I ever feel like it was a conversation I could ever be a part of but I’m here to show you that money talk is for everyone, not just a reserved group of people.\n\nThis is Monzo’s first-ever brand ambassadorship (!!!) so it feels like an even greater, extraordinary milestone to be a part of.\n\nI cannot thank the Monzo team for taking a chance on me and for being a huge part of one of the greatest achievements I could ever achieve. The little British Chinese girl who lived above her parents’ Chinese takeaway would never have believed something like this could ever happen to us 😭♥️\n\nUK Residents. Ts&Cs apply. \n\n#cantonese #monzo #britishbornchinese #chinesetakeaway #monzoambassador",
